  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-039_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I built a shrine to suffering, a knowledge base of tormented truth; but when the mortals rose against us, tried to destroy my great work...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Brain_Jar_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Gray_Man_DM-SCHOL_045.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700165,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-039_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...I abandoned one body to become a beast eternal and guard my precious creation. Until a wayward mystic haplessly swung open its doors.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Brain_Jar_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Gray_Man_DM-SCHOL_046.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700165,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-039_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "His fumbling unleashed the Curse, it ripped me from these walls and trapped me in his wretched frame, which rotted under my power, decayed.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Brain_Jar_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Gray_Man_DM-SCHOL_047.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700165,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-039_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Trapped outside my own wards, I needed spare bodies and influence, and I found both as...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Brain_Jar_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Gray_Man_DM-SCHOL_048.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700165,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC29_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Gray Man!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-SCHOL_088.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675772,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-039_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Precisely. But now I am back, my old power restored to me, and I am emboldened by newfound purpose. Darkmoor is a corrupt and decaying empire...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Brain_Jar_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Gray_Man_DM-SCHOL_049.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700165,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-039_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...I will burn it down, build a new Scholomance from its suffering, and the Spiral entire will be freed from the tyranny of sympathy!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Brain_Jar_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Gray_Man_DM-SCHOL_050.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700165,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC29_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I do not like the chill wind blowing from those gates. We... we have to stop him...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-SCHOL_089.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675772,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC29_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I... I must serve Balaur.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-SCHOL_090.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675772,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC29_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "No, Scion, be our Scion, just this once, please. Go through those gates, fight the Gray Man, Balaur, whoever, and destroy this evil forever!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-SCHOL_091.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675772,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What? the Gray Man was Balaur, who created the Scholomance, then became a dragon, then possessed the guy who opened it, who then rotted away...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_195.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...Leaving behind an active brain, preserved by assistants, that occupied golems made out of monsters?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_196.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC29_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yup.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-SCHOL_092.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675772,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I hate this world. And it sounds like Briar got away?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_197.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Hermit flees, Destruction and Devilry in her wake. She will seek coins and wands and the World itself.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-SCHOL_138.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675588,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And for the blinded Emperor, the cards show only Death.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-SCHOL_139.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675588,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC29_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But she stands alone now. I very much doubt she needs the Broken Branch any longer, nor do we need her.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-SCHOL_093.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675772,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Because they have the cure, a cure that cost us dearly. I don't know how to feel about that, Wizard, I really don't.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_198.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But... I think I need to figure it out here. Come with me.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_199.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Can you believe you just manifested this old thing out of its shadow? I mean, Morganthe tried to do something like that with the Spiral.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_200.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But that required trees, memories of the Song of Creation and so on. This... this was just pure Shadow Magic. Proper Shadow Magic...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_201.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They sense it too. These are the creatures with whom you may have formed a Pact before, right? Looks like they found a new home.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_202.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And I think I have too. At least for now. That's what the Arcanum is supposed to be for, but we spend all our time cloistered away.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_203.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So I'm going to stay, build this School back up, and make the Black Lagoon what it was before the Scholomari.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_204.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This isn't goodbye of course; I'll still help you train your Shadow Spells, just from here now.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_205.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Shadow Nova",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Our tale advances to a new setting, but the formula remains the same. May our bond ever strengthen.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Shadow_Nova_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Shadow_Nova_DM-SCHOL_001.mp3",
