            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Can you believe you just manifested this old thing out of its shadow? I mean, Morganthe tried to do something like that with the Spiral.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_200.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But that required trees, memories of the Song of Creation and so on. This... this was just pure Shadow Magic. Proper Shadow Magic...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_201.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They sense it too. These are the creatures with whom you may have formed a Pact before, right? Looks like they found a new home.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_202.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And I think I have too. At least for now. That's what the Arcanum is supposed to be for, but we spend all our time cloistered away.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_203.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So I'm going to stay, build this School back up, and make the Black Lagoon what it was before the Scholomari.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-SCHOL_204.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
